                  "props": {
                    "text": "Common questions.",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "eyebrow": "Mobile service FAQ"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "faq-list",
                  "type": "widget",
                  "props": {
                    "widget": "faq",
                    "config": {
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "q": "What is Idealease Mobile Service?",
                          "a": "With Idealease Mobile Service, you can schedule service when your vehicles are not operating — during off hours or on weekends — at your location. Highly skilled technicians and well-equipped maintenance vehicles bring service and parts to you."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "What maintenance can be done at my location?",
                          "a": "Our highly trained and skilled Mobile Service technicians can perform up to 80% of all routine and preventive commercial truck maintenance at your location, including scheduled PMs, Mobile Quick Check, minor repairs and DVIR write-ups (vehicle inspections)."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "When can I schedule mobile service?",
                          "a": "During off hours or on weekends, when your vehicles are not operating, at your location."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Who is mobile service for?",
                          "a": "Mobile service helps improve vehicle uptime and reduce fuel costs and driver downtime for fleets of five or more commercial trucks."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Is mobile service available in both South Florida and South Carolina?",
                          "a": "Yes. Idealease of South Florida, with Rechtien Truck Group, offers mobile service, and Carolina Idealease, with Rechtien Truck Group in South Carolina, also offers mobile service. Contact the location nearest you for details."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "How do I get started?",
                          "a": "Send a service request using the form on this page, choosing “Send mobile service to my location,” or contact your nearest location. To find out more about Idealease rentals or leasing, send a rental or lease inquiry and we will get back to you shortly."
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "snapshot": {
                      "items": []
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
